<title>UK: Rank rises as broker upgrades to &quot;hold&quot;.</title>
<headline>Rank rises as broker upgrades to &quot;hold&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Rank Group Plc went against the grain of a weak UK market on Thursday as analysts at NatWest Securities raised the stock to &quot;hold&quot; from &quot;reduce,&quot; traders said.</p>
<p>The stock was up 8-1/2p at 416 by 1529 GMT, extending a bounce since it closed at a 12-month low of 406p on November 5.</p>
<p>Analysts at the brokerage were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 5106</p>
